# 🎤 OPIc Opinion Question - Day30

## Question

Do you think technology has made people's lives better?
Why or why not?

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for 60–90 seconds.

Include:

- Your opinion
- Main reason
- Specific example
- Another reason
- Your conclusion

---

## Challenge

Start with:

> From my perspective,...

Also try to use:

> The main reason is that...

> For example,...

> Another reason is that...

> That's why I think...

---

## Recommended Structure

From my perspective,...

↓

The main reason is that...

↓

For example,...

↓

Another reason is that...

↓

That's why I think...
